 composed of fragments from the 'Bloodflame Nebula'. Once a part of the upper Abyss, these fragments were torn away from the nebula and displaced here by the impact of the Second Great Catastrophe.\n\nObserved within the region are remnants of the fortresses Krotan, Dukysas, and La Miren—as well as Ereshkigal’s brigade. The entrance to Reshanta's Eye is yet to be found, however. The central island is overgrown with clusters of thorn trees mutated by Drana and has been dubbed the 'Red Thorn Crown Isle.'\n\nInitial surveys and attempts to access the area have been delayed due to its location at the outer edge of the Abyss, and the presence of a peculiar force field that repels Daeva of considerable strength. This field continues to hinder a full-scale investigation, and some theorize it may be a barrier established to protect a specific target.","counts":{"flight_ring":23},"pk":"Normal","ride":true},{"id":951,"slug":"dukysas-fortress","name":"Dukysas Fortress","type":"village","lv":[null,null],"poly":[[849,1544],[852,1578],[862,1612],[878,1642],[900,1669],[927,1690],[957,1707],[990,1716],[1024,1720],[1059,1717],[1092,1706],[1122,1690],[1149,1668],[1171,1642],[1187,1611],[1197,1578],[1200,1544],[1197,1510],[1187,1477],[1171,1447],[1149,1420],[1122,1398],[1092,1382],[1059,1372],[1024,1369],[990,1372],[957,1382],[927,1398],[900,1420],[878,1447],[862,1477],[852,1510],[849,1544]],"c":[1024,1544],"monsters":0,"gather":0,"desc":"A southern camp base located in the south of Chaotic Upper Reshanta.","counts":{"kibelisk":1,"flight_ring":2},"pk":"Normal","ride":true},{"id":952,"slug":"krotan-fortress","name":"Krotan Fortress","type":"village","lv":[null,null],"poly":[[849,435],[852,469],[862,502],[878,533],[900,560],[927,581],[957,598],[990,607],[1024,611],[1059,607],[1092,597],[1122,581],[1149,559],[1170,533],[1187,502],[1197,469],[1200,435],[1197,401],[1187,368],[1171,337],[1149,311],[1122,289],[1092,273],[1059,263],[1024,259],[990,263],[957,273],[927,289],[900,311],[878,337],